  "details": "The Rabbids Shopping Cart Item was showcased recently by VRChat and showcased players riding in them, however this item only works for OTHER players. not the one who bought it.\n\nWhen I personally bought this item I was under the impression it was a vehicle I could ride in and control. I do not see the appeal of an Item I cannot use myself, its an item for the people around me and not for myself. In order to fully use this Item requires ANOTHER player to buy the item and spawn it in.",
